(2, 'Road Signs', 'Description Take a photograph of a road sign or road signs found anywhere throughout the world. Be Creative, and Good Luck!', '2002-01-14', '2002-01-31', '2002-02-01', '2002-02-07', 9, 0, 786, 22, 5.793, 8.045, 5.2724, 4.205),
(4, 'Table Shot', 'Description Take your camera, place it on a table-top of any sort, and shoot away. The idea is to get a photograph from an alternate perspective not normally viewed. Good Luck!', '2002-02-01', '2002-02-14', '2002-02-15', '2002-02-21', 20, 2, 2211, 237, 5.488, 8.6, 5.4911, 3.231),
(5, 'Outdoor Macro Shot', 'Description Take a photograph outside, up close and personal with your macro function enabled of anything you can find. Good Luck!', '2002-02-15', '2002-02-28', '2002-03-01', '2002-03-07', 45, 6, 6806, 583, 5.559, 8.517, 5.45423, 3.415),
(6, 'Red', 'Description Photograph your interpretation of the color red. The color red MUST lead to the impact of the photo, and remember, post-camera alterations are outlined in the rules. This means no hue/saturation or other colorizations!', '2002-03-01', '2002-03-10', '2002-03-11', '2002-03-17', 71, 2, 10998, 1011, 5.097, 7.132, 5.14945, 2.911),
(7, 'Self-Portrait', 'Description Take an interesting picture of yourself using your camera''s built-in timer, a mirror, your outstretched arm, or any other method that you can think of. This challenge will help towards growing a stronger community -- so we expect everyone to participate! :)', '2002-03-11', '2002-03-17', '2002-03-18', '2002-03-24', 75, 1, 9015, 755, 4.977, 7.449, 4.82906, 3.084),
(8, 'Night Shot', 'Description Grab your camera when the sun goes down, and take your best night shot! Keep in mind the importance of shutter speed and aperature value on this one. The catch on this challenge is that the photo must be taken during the week of the challenge. If your file doesn''t contain exposure date, we may e-mail you with further instructions.', '2002-03-18', '2002-03-24', '2002-03-25', '2002-03-31', 56, 1, 8396, 770, 5.402, 7.258, 5.34667, 3.149),
(9, 'Architecture', 'Description Use your creativity to capture an interesting shot of architecture. The photograph must be taken this week!', '2002-03-25', '2002-03-31', '2002-04-01', '2002-04-07', 66, 6, 11018, 1487, 5.422, 7.641, 5.53892, 2.406),
(10, 'Curves', 'Description Just like the title says, use your creativity to photograph curvature. The photograph must be taken this week (April 1st - April 7th). Be creative, and good luck!', '2002-04-01', '2002-04-07', '2002-04-08', '2002-04-14', 89, 7, 16721, 2482, 5.385, 7.754, 5.42327, 2.314),
(11, 'Stopped Motion', 'Description Catch your subject mid-action -- that means no motion trails! Let''s see how well your timing meets your creativity. The photo must be taken this week (Apr 8 - 14). Good luck!', '2002-04-08', '2002-04-14', '2002-04-15', '2002-04-21', 95, 7, 19198, 3608, 5.262, 8.039, 5.31927, 2.601),
(12, 'Transitions', 'Description Capture your impression of ''transitions'', and let your creativity really show. Your photo must be taken this week (Apr 15 - 21). Good luck!', '2002-04-15', '2002-04-21', '2002-04-22', '2002-04-28', 104, 3, 20935, 3452, 5.255, 7.471, 5.31373, 2.409),
(13, 'From the Ground Up', 'Description Take your best image from the perspective of the ground up. The photo must be taken this week (4/22-4/28). Use your creativity, and good luck!', '2002-04-22', '2002-04-28', '2002-04-29', '2002-05-05', 103, 8, 19726, 2961, 4.952, 6.765, 4.97912, 3.249),
(14, 'Advertisement', 'Description Here''s the challenge: sell a product! Your job is to photograph a product and have it appeal to your audience: the users of DPChallenge. The product can be _anything_ you want. So be creative! The photo must be taken this week (04/29-05/05).', '2002-04-29', '2002-05-05', '2002-05-06', '2002-05-12', 79, 3, 15999, 2867, 5.387, 7.557, 5.39657, 2.653),
(15, 'Upside Down', 'Description It''s a camera angle. It''s a subject position. It''s whatever your creativity limits you to. Your photo must be taken this week (05/6-05/12). Good luck!', '2002-05-06', '2002-05-12', '2002-05-13', '2002-05-19', 103, 1, 19862, 2289, 4.994, 7.46, 4.85855, 2.181),
(16, 'Games', 'Description Sports games, card games, board games -- it''s your choice. Be creative, and make your game obvious and appealing! The photo must be taken this week (5/13-5/19).', '2002-05-13', '2002-05-19', '2002-05-20', '2002-05-26', 94, 3, 19174, 2502, 5.353, 7.754, 5.34328, 3.273),
(17, 'People', 'Description Some of the best subjects are the ones we have the least control over. Capture anything you want, so long as your photo has a live person in it. Your photograph must be taken this week (May 20 - May 26).', '2002-05-20', '2002-05-26', '2002-05-27', '2002-06-02', 107, 1, 23376, 2529, 5.244, 8.14, 5.21423, 3.073),
(18, 'Black & White', 'Description This challenge is completely open: take a picture of ANYTHING you want, as long as the final result is in black and white. With the new rules, you are free to shoot in color and alter the photograph in your digital darkroom (image editing software of your choice). Since the technical part of this challenge is a given, you should rely on your creativity to separate you from the pack. The photograph MUST be taken during the week of the challenge (May 27 - Jun 2).', '2002-05-27', '2002-06-02', '2002-06-03', '2002-06-09', 153, 10, 36626, 3658, 5.378, 7.92, 5.38297, 2.988),
(19, 'On the Road', 'Description Let your imagination run wild, but just keep it on the road. You must take the photo this week (06/03 - 06/09).', '2002-06-03', '2002-06-09', '2002-06-10', '2002-06-16', 108, 2, 24568, 2539, 5.254, 7.294, 5.21304, 3.482),
(20, 'Shadows', 'Description Use lighting to your advantage, and capture an interesting shot of shadows. Let your creativity run wild, just make sure to take the picture this week (6/10-6/16).', '2002-06-10', '2002-06-16', '2002-06-17', '2002-06-23', 138, 2, 30488, 2837, 4.953, 7.062, 5.01852, 2.17),
(21, 'City Life', 'Description This might be relative to where you live, but hit the streets and capture your best representation of ''City Life''. The photograph must be taken this week (6/17-6/23). Good Luck!', '2002-06-17', '2002-06-23', '2002-06-24', '2002-06-30', 112, 1, 24711, 2584, 5.278, 7.455, 5.25346, 3.344),
(22, 'Transparency', 'Description Take a shot of anything that''s semi-transparent. Play with distortion and colors in objects like cups, eye glasses, stained glass. Be creative, and good luck. The shot must be taken this week (6-24 thru 6-30).', '2002-06-24', '2002-06-30', '2002-07-01', '2002-07-07', 148, 2, 34852, 2743, 5.159, 8.304, 5.1752, 3.261),
(23, 'Fear', 'Description This one might take a little more thought. Photograph your best interpretation of ''Fear'' in any shape or form. Remember, your photograph must be taken this week (07/01 - 07/07)!', '2002-07-01', '2002-07-07', '2002-07-08', '2002-07-14', 110, 4, 31113, 3231, 4.801, 7.449, 4.90357, 3.295),
(24, 'Free Study', 'Description This is your chance to put your new skills to the test. Photograph anything you like, so long as you shoot it this week (7/8-7/14). Good luck, and have fun!', '2002-07-08', '2002-07-14', '2002-07-15', '2002-07-21', 175, 4, 55879, 6177, 5.316, 7.247, 5.33667, 2.863),
(25, 'Texture', 'Description Keep your eyes open this week and capture your best representation of ''texture''. Your photograph must be taken this week (7/15-7/21).', '2002-07-15', '2002-07-21', '2002-07-22', '2002-07-28', 218, 1, 56208, 4972, 5.165, 7.249, 5.17375, 3.121),
(26, 'The Corporate World', 'Description The DOW is dropping and scandal is around every corner. Take a shot best representing your views of the Corporate World and/or its effect on society. The photograph must be taken this week (7-22 thru 7-28).', '2002-07-22', '2002-07-28', '2002-07-29', '2002-08-04', 116, 2, 28510, 2270, 4.941, 7.421, 4.92742, 2.804),
(27, 'Something Old', 'Description Use your photographic technique to emphasize the age of your subject. Good luck! And remember... your photo must be taken this week (7/29-8/4)!', '2002-07-29', '2002-08-04', '2002-08-05', '2002-08-11', 180, 5, 47390, 3923, 5.278, 6.871, 5.36759, 3.074),
(28, 'Something New', 'Description Not likely to be followed by "Something Borrowed" or "Something Blue", this challenge is to take your best shot of "Something New"! Remember, you must take the picture this week (8/5-8/11).', '2002-08-05', '2002-08-11', '2002-08-12', '2002-08-18', 168, 0, 42797, 3841, 4.991, 7.197, 4.9761, 2.553),
(29, 'Pencil', 'Description Take your pencil anywhere, do anything you like to it, but make the shot your own. Your photograph must physically contain a pencil and must be taken this week (8/12-8/18). Creativity is essential.', '2002-08-12', '2002-08-18', '2002-08-19', '2002-08-25', 185, 3, 49139, 4425, 5.34, 7.636, 5.33084, 2.707),
(30, 'Childhood Without Children', 'Description Capture your impression of "childhood" without having a child in your picture! Remember, you must take your picture this week (8/19-8/25).', '2002-08-19', '2002-08-25', '2002-08-26', '2002-09-01', 172, 0, 42121, 3854, 5.14, 7.234, 5.08537, 3.289),
(31, 'Candid', 'Description Take your camera with you everywhere this week, and capture a candid moment. Try to emphasize the mood of the moment while not forgetting the technical elements of photography. Your submission must be taken this week (8/26-9/1).', '2002-08-26', '2002-09-01', '2002-09-02', '2002-09-08', 172, 1, 49036, 3411, 5.254, 8.109, 5.2439, 3.15),
(32, 'Fruits and Vegetables', 'Description Photograph a fruit. Photograph a vegetable. Photograph a fruit and a vegetable. Photograph as few or as many as you like. Whatever you do, make sure you photograph this week (9/2-9/8).', '2002-09-02', '2002-09-08', '2002-09-09', '2002-09-15', 201, 2, 53279, 4470, 5.329, 7.473, 5.28316, 2.844),
(33, 'Negative Space', 'Description In a photograph, the space around the object is just as important as the object itself. Use this surrounding space to create the wow of the image. Your negative space shot must be taken this week (9/9-9/15).', '2002-09-09', '2002-09-15', '2002-09-16', '2002-09-22', 218, 2, 69585, 5073, 5.273, 7.401, 5.24841, 2.943),
(34, 'Your Corner of the World', 'Description Photograph something that represents your corner of the world. This can be anything as small as something in your bedroom, to something as large as a city or state landmark. Your photograph must be taken this week (9/16-9/22).', '2002-09-16', '2002-09-22', '2002-09-23', '2002-09-29', 245, 1, 72807, 4680, 5.434, 7.52, 5.39687, 3.203),
(35, 'Reflections Without Mirrors', 'Description Photographing a reflection is easy. Now, here''s the hard part: don''t use a mirror as your reflective surface and don''t show your camera in the picture! Your photograph must be taken this week (9/23-9/29).', '2002-09-23', '2002-09-29', '2002-09-30', '2002-10-06', 248, 4, 69592, 4160, 5.319, 7.901, 5.34035, 3.1),
