(511, '30 Seconds or More', 'Description Make an image that uses an exposure time of 30 seconds or longer. EXIF data will be used to validate exposure times.', '2006-06-14', '2006-06-20', '2006-06-21', '2006-06-27', 170, 8, 63130, 3353, 5.44553, 7.2569, 5.515, 3.299),
(512, 'Bokeh II', 'Description Loosely defined, bokeh is the quality and "feel" of the out-of-focus foreground or background elements of a photo. It isn''t very interesting by itself, but take a photograph whose subject is enhanced by the bokeh of the background.', '2006-06-14', '2006-06-20', '2006-06-21', '2006-06-27', 432, 6, 114010, 5948, 5.21081, 7.1986, 5.2725, 2.5634),
(513, 'Motion Blur II', 'Description Intentional motion blur is an effect that can be achieved by zooming on a stationary subject, panning a moving subject, using long exposure, etc. Search for subjects that will be enhanced by this treatment.', '2006-06-19', '2006-06-25', '2006-06-26', '2006-07-02', 177, 2, 33915, 2279, 5.402, 7.078, 5.3824, 3.72),
(514, 'Superstitions & Urban Legends II', 'Description Photograph a well-known superstition or urban legend. Keep in mind your target audience as you photograph, since this site spans the globe.', '2006-06-21', '2006-06-27', '2006-06-28', '2006-07-04', 97, 5, 32077, 2547, 5.3992, 7.1111, 5.3014, 3.9911),
(515, 'Glass II (with a twist)', 'Description Creatively shoot anything made of glass EXCEPT an object intended to hold a liquid; NO wineglasses, NO martini glasses, NO water glasses or tumblers, NO glass vases, you get the idea...', '2006-06-21', '2006-06-27', '2006-06-28', '2006-07-04', 258, 3, 72097, 3649, 5.17, 7.739, 5.10335, 3.395),
(516, 'Flowers', 'Description It''s possibly the most reviled topic in DPC; not a week goes by without someone bemoaning the preponderance of flowers in one challenge or another. So let''s get ''em out of our system! Your challenge is simple; shoot a flower or flowers. Indoors, outdoors, blooming or fading, pressed between the pages of a book, we don''t care, as long as FLOWERS are the subject of your photo. Pay attention to the light, and throw your creativity at this one folks!', '2006-06-26', '2006-07-02', '2006-07-03', '2006-07-09', 375, 3, 73159, 4626, 5.52, 7.682, 5.4873, 3.963),
(517, 'Stationary', 'Description That is with an A not an E, so it means not moving.', '2006-06-28', '2006-07-04', '2006-07-05', '2006-07-11', 284, 3, 62066, 2576, 5.21928, 7.6057, 5.1855, 3.5814),
(518, 'Stationery', 'Description Simply photograph stationery.', '2006-06-28', '2006-07-04', '2006-07-05', '2006-07-11', 122, 4, 33466, 2608, 5.31554, 7.1848, 5.26555, 2.7094),
(519, 'Straight from the Camera', 'Description It''s been suggested so many times, we''re going to give it a whirl. Your challenge is to give us your best image STRAIGHT FROM THE CAMERA. The original MUST be a jpg; you may not use RAW for this challenge. Absolutely NO post-processing is allowed except resizing and compression for the web. That''s right; no cropping, no rotating, no image adjustments, no sharpening, no cloning, no borders, no nothing. Have fun!', '2006-07-01', '2006-07-02', '2006-07-03', '2006-07-09', 389, 6, 74166, 3256, 5.413, 7.361, 5.32695, 3.52),
(520, 'The Number 10', 'Description You''ll get no help from us here: make of it what you will.', '2006-07-03', '2006-07-09', '2006-07-10', '2006-07-16', 219, 4, 42352, 2234, 5.4103, 7.229, 5.3529, 3.731),
