(539, 'Camera "Self Portrait"', 'Description Our cameras are essential to our work, but they never get star billing; they are always working behind the scenes. It''s time they got their moment in the limelight. Your challenge; use your camera to take a picture of itself.', '2006-08-09', '2006-08-15', '2006-08-16', '2006-08-22', 143, 2, 35323, 1912, 5.33706, 6.9847, 5.375, 2.5537),
