(548, 'Pastels', 'Description DPC voters tend to favor highly-saturated colors, so we see a lot of them in our challenges. This week, we''re asking for something different; PASTELS. Pastels are commonly defined as "a light, pale tint of color". Your challenge is to look at the world in a softer light this week, and show us what you''ve found.', '2006-08-28', '2006-09-03', '2006-09-04', '2006-09-10', 203, 4, 37513, 2652, 5.54856, 6.8929, 5.5806, 4.0214),
(549, 'Rule of Thirds II', 'Description The rule of thirds suggests that if you picture imaginary lines dividing your photograph in thirds (horizontally and vertically), your points of interest should be placed on the intersections of those lines. Your challenge is to take an interesting photograph using this technique.', '2006-08-30', '2006-09-05', '2006-09-06', '2006-09-12', 320, 1, 67717, 2462, 5.4748, 7.0944, 5.4577, 3.4146),
