(554, 'School Days: Geometry', 'Description Geometry is the branch of mathematics that deals with the measurement, properties, and relationships of points, lines, angles, surfaces, and solids. Creatively capture one or more of these geometric elements in your photo.', '2006-09-06', '2006-09-12', '2006-09-13', '2006-09-19', 182, 2, 28679, 1409, 5.29063, 7.2061, 5.3014, 3.35),
