(588, 'The Year You Were Born', 'Description Take us back to yesteryear by photographing something that defined the year you were born. Start googling, looking through old news papers and magazines, and show us your photographic interpretation of the year of your birth. Your title should should include the year.', '2006-11-15', '2006-11-21', '2006-11-22', '2006-11-28', 102, 0, 30288, 1886, 5.65438, 6.9133, 5.7049, 3.5745),
(589, 'Perspective IV', 'Description Use perspective to create a dramatic effect with your photograph.', '2006-11-15', '2006-11-21', '2006-11-22', '2006-11-28', 319, 5, 53861, 2533, 5.54953, 7.4921, 5.5, 4.0181),
(590, 'Light on White III', 'Description Take a photo in which the background is white and the subject is predominately a "light" color. Be mindful of over-exposing your highlights!', '2006-11-20', '2006-11-26', '2006-11-27', '2006-12-03', 233, 0, 45113, 2219, 5.48046, 7.2488, 5.46245, 3.6134),
(591, 'Famous Last Words', 'Description Title your image with your idea of "famous last words" and show us your interpretation of same. Examples: "I saw this on TV once..."; "Trust me, I''m a pro!"; and "He won''t bite!";', '2006-11-22', '2006-11-28', '2006-11-29', '2006-12-05', 112, 2, 33046, 1508, 5.71364, 7.1158, 5.7467, 4.0279),
(592, 'Diagonal', 'Description Most of us tend to default to compositions that are oriented around strong horizontal or vertical axes. Your challenge this week is to incorporate a diagonal axis as the major compositional thrust of your image. Note that this does NOT require the presence of a diagonal "line".', '2006-11-22', '2006-11-28', '2006-11-29', '2006-12-05', 345, 2, 63211, 3032, 5.40164, 7.466, 5.343, 3.8066),
(593, 'Bond, James Bond', 'Description Take your inspiration this week from any of the many James Bond (007) movies or books. Title your submission with the name of the work that inspired it.', '2006-11-27', '2006-12-03', '2006-12-04', '2006-12-10', 96, 7, 19232, 1403, 5.53619, 7.4844, 5.4601, 4.3448),
(594, 'Life II', 'Description Create an image that celebrates life.', '2006-11-29', '2006-12-05', '2006-12-06', '2006-12-12', 163, 6, 35930, 2230, 5.50406, 7.0826, 5.46775, 3.7778),
(595, 'Death', 'Description Create an image that explores death.', '2006-11-29', '2006-12-05', '2006-12-06', '2006-12-12', 227, 6, 45973, 2358, 5.19372, 7.0939, 5.2009, 3.822),
(596, 'Free Study XVI', 'Description Sixteen. Happy December!', '2006-12-01', '2006-12-31', '2007-01-01', '2007-01-07', 488, 3, 86273, 3966, 5.60289, 7.388, 5.5449, 3.8313),
(597, 'Dirt', 'Description N/A', '2006-12-04', '2006-12-10', '2006-12-11', '2006-12-17', 144, 2, 27105, 2134, 5.54577, 7.3221, 5.4948, 3.9661),
(598, 'For Sale', 'Description Supermarkets, malls, convenience marts, farmers markets, flea markets, garage sales: all around us there is stuff for sale and places to sell it. This week, focus on creatively capturing an image of someplace where you can buy stuff or something that is for sale.', '2006-12-06', '2006-12-12', '2006-12-13', '2006-12-19', 120, 6, 28798, 1455, 5.39597, 6.8704, 5.3858, 3.4818),
(599, 'Pet Portrait II', 'Description N/A', '2006-12-06', '2006-12-12', '2006-12-13', '2006-12-19', 378, 4, 95897, 5512, 5.56799, 7.6115, 5.5606, 3.5863),
(600, 'Sky', 'Description Make the sky a key element of your photograph.', '2006-12-08', '2006-12-14', '2006-12-15', '2006-12-21', 123, 1, 32306, 1855, 5.89364, 8.044, 5.9082, 3.996),
(601, 'Sticky', 'Description N/A', '2006-12-11', '2006-12-17', '2006-12-18', '2006-12-24', 100, 3, 18086, 1267, 5.46257, 7.3833, 5.5056, 3.5249),
(602, 'Brown', 'Description Let''s face it; "brown" is arguably the least-appreciated color of them all. But every color deserves its day: this week, it''s brown''s turn to bask in the limelight.', '2006-12-13', '2006-12-19', '2006-12-20', '2006-12-26', 306, 8, 60848, 3488, 5.30555, 7.662, 5.3578, 3.6493),
(603, 'Pink Floyd', 'Description Choose a song title or song lyrics from the classic rock band Pink Floyd and take a photo to match.', '2006-12-13', '2006-12-19', '2006-12-20', '2006-12-26', 151, 5, 31837, 2009, 5.61758, 7.7924, 5.56375, 3.4977),
(604, 'Your Occupation II', 'Description Take a photograph representing what you do for a living. Don''t work? Take a photograph representing what you do most of the time.', '2006-12-18', '2006-12-24', '2006-12-25', '2006-12-31', 105, 1, 24778, 1852, 5.83586, 7.0947, 5.7627, 3.8448);
