(605, 'AA Battery', 'Description AA Batteries (also known as LR6) are used in virtually all small portable electronics and toys, so now''s your chance to take them out of their compartments and show as many of them as you like to the world!', '2006-12-20', '2006-12-26', '2006-12-27', '2007-01-02', 142, 2, 39115, 2099, 5.36653, 7.4385, 5.2616, 3.9925),
(606, 'Pattern II', 'Description Take a photograph where patterns grab the viewer''s attention.', '2006-12-20', '2006-12-26', '2006-12-27', '2007-01-02', 250, 2, 53753, 2644, 5.46749, 7.3333, 5.41375, 3.3776),
(607, 'Harsh Environments', 'Description N/A', '2006-12-22', '2006-12-28', '2006-12-29', '2007-01-04', 116, 1, 25172, 2138, 5.74066, 7.1013, 5.7599, 4.2),
(608, '12 Days Of Christmas', 'Description Illustrate your take on one (or more) days of Christmas, based on the traditional song. Have fun!', '2006-12-25', '2006-12-31', '2007-01-01', '2007-01-07', 58, 2, 12235, 918, 5.46686, 7.0787, 5.4286, 4.1435),
(609, 'Fences', 'Description The fences we are referring to are actual, physical fences; some are decorative, some are protective, some mark boundaries, some are for erosion control. Think about fences, and give us YOUR perspective :-)', '2006-12-27', '2007-01-02', '2007-01-03', '2007-01-09', 315, 0, 77777, 3476, 5.43814, 7.5148, 5.40925, 3.1983),
(610, 'Centered Composition II', 'Description Take a picture where the main subject is in the center of the composition.', '2006-12-27', '2007-01-02', '2007-01-03', '2007-01-09', 415, 5, 82723, 4207, 5.38594, 7.625, 5.3153, 3.0922),
(611, 'Fireworks II', 'Description Ring in the new year by capturing a display of fireworks.', '2006-12-31', '2007-01-01', '2007-01-02', '2007-01-08', 74, 1, 16076, 1020, 5.79423, 7.8225, 5.77975, 2.9323),
(612, 'Procrastination', 'Description Show us what you put off doing all last year.', '2007-01-01', '2007-01-07', '2007-01-08', '2007-01-14', 132, 2, 26584, 2255, 5.41258, 6.8278, 5.4286, 3.5922),
(613, 'Song Titles, 2006', 'Description Create a photo using the title from a song on Rick Dee''s 50 most requested songs of 2006 list, here.', '2007-01-03', '2007-01-09', '2007-01-10', '2007-01-16', 219, 5, 61204, 3021, 5.54157, 7.4385, 5.52515, 3.0643),
(614, 'Black and White Portrait II', 'Description N/A', '2007-01-03', '2007-01-09', '2007-01-10', '2007-01-16', 491, 11, 142578, 6635, 5.25361, 7.4026, 5.21085, 2.3908),
(615, 'Free Study 2007-01', 'Description Happy New Year!', '2007-01-01', '2007-01-31', '2007-02-01', '2007-02-07', 559, 3, 84816, 3983, 5.59347, 7.4125, 5.60685, 3.0676),
(616, 'Best of 2006', 'Description Submit your best shot of 2006 -- a shot that hasn''t appeared in any previous challenge.', '2007-01-05', '2007-01-11', '2007-01-12', '2007-01-25', 712, 9, 247126, 15446, 5.78078, 7.4392, 5.7539, 3.7348),
(617, 'Battle Of The Sexes', 'Description Men are from Mars, women are from Venus: small wonder that the "battle of the sexes" is always with us. Show us your take on this ageless theme.', '2007-01-08', '2007-01-14', '2007-01-15', '2007-01-21', 90, 1, 23580, 1256, 5.386, 6.8536, 5.3569, 3.7663),
(618, 'Motion Panning II', 'Description In photography, panning is a technique used to suggest fast motion and bring out foreground from background. Use this panning technique to create your submission.', '2007-01-10', '2007-01-16', '2007-01-17', '2007-01-23', 131, 4, 43256, 2268, 5.35983, 7.4633, 5.346, 3.1969),
(619, 'Match', 'Description Matchstick, tennis match, matching clothing: there are plenty of matches all around you. Pick one and take your best shot at it!', '2007-01-10', '2007-01-16', '2007-01-17', '2007-01-23', 248, 4, 47538, 1788, 5.22584, 6.9171, 5.2105, 3.8804),
(620, 'Wildlife III', 'Description For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment. Now that you know what to photograph, take your best shot!', '2007-01-15', '2007-01-21', '2007-01-22', '2007-01-28', 218, 2, 52776, 3772, 5.80207, 8.3, 5.77485, 3.69),
