(635, 'Street Photography', 'Description Long associated with photography, photographers like Henri Cartier-Bresson took street photography to the realm of art. Do your best to capture a quality photograph using street photography techniques.', '2007-02-12', '2007-02-18', '2007-02-19', '2007-02-25', 288, 4, 65742, 3416, 5.59785, 7.1176, 5.54045, 4.1034),
