(651, 'Multiple Light Sources II', 'Description Lighting is the most important element in photography. Make the obvious use of multiple light sources a key factor in your composition this week. As always, use your imagination and be creative!', '2007-03-14', '2007-03-20', '2007-03-21', '2007-03-27', 159, 5, 30179, 1135, 5.54064, 7.1435, 5.5436, 3.4388),
(652, 'Cell Phone Mania', 'Description It seems that everyone today has one. You see people talking on them in their car, walking down the street, while eating, coming out of work and school. This week capture an interesting photo of a person using their cellular phone.', '2007-03-14', '2007-03-20', '2007-03-21', '2007-03-27', 118, 1, 26847, 1594, 5.42604, 7.6759, 5.3607, 3.4505),
(653, 'Langdon''s Birthday', 'Description Thursday the 22nd is Langdon''s birthday, and he needs to wake up to a challenge full of birthday gifts. What will you get Langdon for his 27th birthday?', '2007-03-15', '2007-03-21', '2007-03-22', '2007-03-28', 107, 2, 19156, 925, 5.6683, 7.1474, 5.609, 4.4341),
