(671, 'Bubbles II', 'Description We''re revisiting our first two Exclusive Open Challenges this week. For this one, make your viewer think "BUBBLES" when they see your entry.', '2007-04-18', '2007-04-24', '2007-04-25', '2007-05-01', 172, 4, 44607, 2431, 5.40637, 7.4965, 5.39185, 3.1016),
