(1130, 'Macro Without Bugs or Flowers III', 'Description Take a macro shot (or at least an extreme close-up) of something that is not a bug or flower. (For the purpose of this challenge, "bug" refers to any insect, arachnid, worm, larvae, etc. that would be classified in the arthropoda phylum.)', '2009-11-25', '2009-12-01', '2009-12-02', '2009-12-08', 198, 4, 40191, 1265, 5.16441, 7.0237, 5.1471, 2.9657),
