(1132, 'Tilt Shift', 'Description Tilt-shift photography refers to the use of camera movements, and sometimes specifically refers to the use of tilt for selective focus, often for simulating a miniature scene. Use this technique while shooting and processing your entry this week.', '2009-11-27', '2009-12-03', '2009-12-04', '2009-12-10', 54, 0, 8566, 328, 5.74049, 7.2883, 5.7081, 3.7438),
