(1134, 'A Bug''s Life: Insects, Bugs, Beetle', 'Description It''s simple in concept, difficult in execution; get out in the field and shoot a "bug" (or bugs) in its natural environment.', '2009-12-02', '2009-12-08', '2009-12-09', '2009-12-15', 49, 3, 11320, 772, 6.01917, 8.024, 6.1382, 4.4163),
