(1606, 'Mystery Word Triptych', 'Description Capture three separate photographs to combine as a triptych with a secret word in mind. The title of your entry should hint at what that word is, but should not include the word (or any variation of the word). Voters should leave their guess along with feedback during voting.', '2012-07-13', '2012-07-19', '2012-07-20', '2012-07-26', 59, 3, 6534, 2092, 5.97383, 7.2017, 5.9035, 4.6864),
