(1791, 'Rain III', 'Description Take the month (minus a day) to find and photograph some rain. Be careful with your electronic bits, and good luck!', '2013-08-02', '2013-08-31', '2013-09-01', '2013-09-07', 72, 0, 5447, 181, 5.65504, 7.2658, 5.68, 4.4583),
(1792, 'Bokeh VIII', 'Description Loosely defined, bokeh is the quality and "feel" of the out-of-focus foreground or background elements of a photo. It isn''t very interesting by itself, but take a photograph whose subject is enhanced by the bokeh of the background.', '2013-08-05', '2013-08-11', '2013-08-12', '2013-08-18', 88, 0, 7850, 705, 5.69006, 7.1053, 5.7033, 4.2771),
(1793, 'Warm Colors III', 'Description Create a photograph that is comprised of primarily warm colors.', '2013-08-07', '2013-08-13', '2013-08-14', '2013-08-20', 93, 0, 9748, 422, 5.56986, 7.1389, 5.56665, 3.729),
(1794, 'Closed', 'Description Whether it be a closed door, closed store, closed eyes, or closed mind, it just needs to give the viewer the notion that something is closed.', '2013-08-09', '2013-08-16', '2013-08-17', '2013-08-23', 71, 2, 5821, 345, 5.33791, 6.8605, 5.3152, 3.7037),
(1795, 'Landscape in Portrait Orientation II', 'Description Your challenge this week: go out and "see" the landscape differently. Seek out and capture a vertically-framed landscape image.', '2013-08-12', '2013-08-18', '2013-08-19', '2013-08-25', 82, 1, 9200, 585, 5.59728, 7.2966, 5.5727, 3.6574),
(1796, 'Not My Style', 'Description Step out of your comfort zone this week and try to emulate the style of another photographer on DPChallenge.', '2013-08-14', '2013-08-20', '2013-08-21', '2013-08-27', 75, 2, 6723, 431, 5.70995, 7.0851, 5.74325, 4.3333),
(1797, 'Mysterious', 'Description Capture a photo of something which is not easily comprehended or explained.', '2013-08-16', '2013-08-22', '2013-08-23', '2013-08-29', 62, 1, 5901, 210, 5.62803, 6.6869, 5.6421, 4.6316),
(1798, 'Image Grain VI', 'Description Take a photo that effectively uses noise grain to make an impact on the viewer. Use of high ISO recommended, adding noise in post production is OK too.', '2013-08-19', '2013-08-25', '2013-08-26', '2013-09-01', 91, 0, 8227, 337, 5.60897, 7.2222, 5.5673, 4.1461),
(1799, 'Self Portrait VIII', 'Description Create a self portrait.', '2013-08-21', '2013-08-27', '2013-08-28', '2013-09-03', 81, 0, 11826, 712, 5.7125, 7.5274, 5.7611, 3.8014),
(1800, 'The Amazing Minimal Editing Ruleset', 'Description Go out and shoot something that will blow away the voters. The catch? It must be done within the Minimal Editing ruleset. This is an opportunity - either to learn, or to show off what you''ve learned.', '2013-08-23', '2013-08-29', '2013-08-30', '2013-09-05', 77, 0, 6660, 358, 5.64685, 7.3708, 5.5774, 4.1429),
(1801, 'Overexposed II', 'Description Create a photograph that is purposefully overexposed for its effectiveness.', '2013-08-26', '2013-09-01', '2013-09-02', '2013-09-08', 66, 0, 4616, 153, 5.47552, 6.8493, 5.3571, 4.1471),
