(2126, 'Canada Day', 'Description If youi live there, you know it. If you don''t, study up! Let''s celebrate Canada Day with our friends to the North!', '2015-07-01', '2015-07-07', '2015-07-08', '2015-07-14', 34, 1, 2504, 118, 5.55911, 7.1184, 5.64475, 3.9221),
