(2162, 'Wear & Tear', 'Description Sooner or later, everything wears out, breaks down, dissolves, crumbles, rusts out, sinks, or otherwise slides into decrepitude. Sometimes deterioration can even be beautiful :-)', '2015-09-14', '2015-09-20', '2015-09-21', '2015-09-27', 54, 0, 3696, 126, 5.58009, 6.5286, 5.5857, 4.5735),
