(2175, 'Good Vibes for Jan (Cutout)', 'Description One of DPC''s most original artists has been weathering a rough stretch recently. Let''s reach out to cutout and show him how much we value him.', '2015-10-07', '2015-10-13', '2015-10-14', '2015-10-20', 63, 0, 3513, 203, 5.90122, 6.9818, 5.8928, 4.875),
