(2189, 'DIY Google Street View', 'Description There''s a certain mystique and weirdness to some Google Street View images. Coincidental, mysterious, strange, vexing, funny ... you never know. Use your camera and your creativity to create an image that looks as if it would be found on Google Street View.', '2015-11-06', '2015-11-12', '2015-11-13', '2015-11-19', 23, 0, 1490, 75, 5.74564, 6.5303, 5.7308, 4.75),
