(2643, 'Color Slides  A Minimal Challenge', 'Description Remember back in the day? You used to drop a roll of slide film off to be published, then you got them back and had slide shows" for your friends and family? What you shot was what you got? Let''s do that again! Shoot and enter, Minimal Editing Rules.', '2018-04-04', '2018-04-17', '2018-04-18', '2018-04-24', 37, 1, 1721, 59, 5.45206, 6.5625, 5.45045, 3.8696),
