(2645, 'Landscape Without Subject', 'Description While it''s often said that the "best" landscapes are those that have a subject which dominates or informs the composition, this is far from universally true. For this challenge, show us the breadth and scope of your vision as you photograph a landscape/seascape without a dominant subject.', '2018-04-09', '2018-04-22', '2018-04-23', '2018-04-29', 32, 1, 1360, 80, 5.62647, 6.8636, 5.6554, 4.7209),
(2646, 'Tilt-Shift IV', 'Description Tilt-shift photography refers to tilting the lens so it is not parallel to the image plane, classically to increase DOF and, more currently, specifically to selectively REDUCE the zone of focus, often to simulate a miniature scene. Use this technique while shooting and/or processing your entry for this challenge.', '2018-04-11', '2018-04-24', '2018-04-25', '2018-05-01', 22, 0, 1254, 59, 5.53429, 6.7414, 5.5536, 4.0357),
(2647, 'Nude VII (Archival)', 'Description Its been five years since we did a nude challenge. Here, you can shoot a new nude or revisit your archives and access your sets for any of the previous six nude challenges.', '2018-04-13', '2018-04-26', '2018-04-27', '2018-05-03', 22, 2, 909, 57, 5.86909, 7.0, 5.8, 3.9783),
