(2661, 'Norman Rockwell II', 'Description Take a photo in the style of the immensely popular, determinedly "folksy" American artist Norman Rockwell. Create an image that captures that idyllic, optimistic, often humorous spirit - not necessarily a recreation of one of his paintings.', '2018-05-11', '2018-05-24', '2018-05-25', '2018-05-31', 12, 0, 491, 27, 5.82485, 6.9048, 5.7561, 4.575),
