(2664, 'Kodachrome', 'Description It was arguably the greatest color EVER: saturated, a lovely contrast pop, incredible detail. Study up on Kodachrome images (google Steve McCurry and Nat Geo for starters) and give us your best shot at emulating the iconic color film of the last half of the 20th century.', '2018-05-16', '2018-05-29', '2018-05-30', '2018-06-05', 36, 0, 2059, 72, 5.73191, 6.8621, 5.7895, 4.5),
(2665, 'Homophonic Pairs', 'Description Homophones are words that sound the same but mean something different, e.g. "Bear" and "Bare". Make a diptych to show us a homophonic pair.', '2018-05-18', '2018-05-31', '2018-06-01', '2018-06-07', 19, 0, 685, 39, 5.69489, 6.4865, 5.71015, 4.5),
