(2670, 'Atmospheric Perspective', 'Description Atmospheric Perspective is the effect on the appearance of an object by the atmosphere between it and the viewer. A distant object may appear to be more blue or hazy, for instance. Use atmospheric perspective to create an effective photo.', '2018-05-30', '2018-06-12', '2018-06-13', '2018-06-19', 36, 0, 2446, 84, 5.91047, 7.7183, 5.8806, 4.7015),
