(2825, 'Black & White VI', 'Description Shoot whatever you like, but give us the B&W version. Sepia-toned images, or Selenium-toned, and the like, are still considered B&W.', '2019-03-25', '2019-04-07', '2019-04-08', '2019-04-14', 74, 1, 4202, 168, 5.66516, 6.7544, 5.6607, 4.75),
