(2827, 'Perspective Compression', 'Description Compress several layers of distance within a scene into a relatively "flat" view (with a seemingly shrunken distance between the layers) by your choice of perspective, cropping, and/or composition.', '2019-03-29', '2019-04-11', '2019-04-12', '2019-04-18', 20, 0, 757, 17, 5.45575, 6.5526, 5.4103, 4.4737),
