(2846, ' In the style of James Ravilious', 'Description A splendid B&W Photographer. Complement his style and vision.', '2019-05-06', '2019-05-19', '2019-05-20', '2019-05-26', 38, 0, 1607, 143, 5.82701, 7.0, 5.7442, 5.1628),
