(2862, 'A Bug''s Life: Insects, Bugs, Beetles IV', 'Description It''s simple in concept, difficult in execution; get out in the field and shoot a "bug" (or bugs) in its natural environment.', '2019-06-05', '2019-06-18', '2019-06-19', '2019-06-25', 42, 0, 2738, 134, 6.16472, 8.0462, 6.1212, 3.9063),
