(2921, 'Vintage & Veteran Vehicles (RIP Robin)', 'Description Kiwinick''s brother-in-law passed away a month ago. He was an inveterate collector of vintage and veteran autos and left 40 of them behind. This challenge is for nick, remembering Robin :-)', '2019-10-02', '2019-10-15', '2019-10-16', '2019-10-22', 24, 1, 953, 55, 5.65477, 6.9024, 6.025, 3.75),
(2922, 'Grace Slick''s White Rabbit (ARCHIVAL)', 'Description Let''s see what Grace Slick''s iconic Rock Anthem conjures up in YOU. Check out the lyrics and take us wherever they take you :-)', '2019-10-04', '2019-10-17', '2019-10-18', '2019-10-24', 29, 0, 1008, 35, 5.78869, 7.6857, 5.8824, 4.8),
