(2924, 'Clouds Only', 'Description Looking up is good for the spirit. Photograph clouds only: no telephone wires, distant horizons, slivers of sea, trees, birds, airplanes, nothing but clouds and otherwise-naked sky.', '2019-10-09', '2019-10-22', '2019-10-23', '2019-10-29', 55, 1, 3248, 87, 5.40764, 6.6333, 5.55655, 2.5577),
