(3142, 'In the Spirit of Kiwinick', 'Description Nick is a big part of this community, and it would be wonderful to honor his contributions to DPChallenge. He has a charming, direct style that honors the beauty and emotions of our daily lives, especially in our domestic, local realms. His fondness for animals, especially our pets, stands out. Always apparent is his heartfelt, sincere, and life-affirming personality. Do your best to share a photograph in his warm spirit.', '2020-12-04', '2020-12-17', '2020-12-18', '2020-12-24', 39, 0, 1509, 110, 5.91849, 7.0, 5.89605, 5.0769),
