(3260, 'Ghost Town', 'Description The phrase Ghost Town can be a literal term to describe a town that is deserted (Webster''s Definition here) or sometimes used more casually, as in "this place is a ghost town" - like a description for a nearly empty bar / restaurant / shopping center, etc.', '2021-07-19', '2021-08-01', '2021-08-02', '2021-08-08', 16, 0, 430, 5, 5.76744, 6.5926, 5.8462, 4.6786),
(3261, 'The Smile IV (ARCHIVAL)', 'From the grin to the laughing smile, a smile is one emotion that photographers have sought to capture since the early days of photography. Playing to the phrase "smile for the camera", take a picture of a person or persons that best captures this emotion.', '2021-07-21', '2021-08-03', '2021-08-04', '2021-08-10', 37, 0, 1121, 24, 5.55665, 6.6, 5.6552, 3.7667),
