(3319, 'Through the Looking Glass', 'Description Take a photo where your subject is reflected in a mirror. The camera must NOT be visible in the photo. The mirror MUST be visible. Failure to follow visibility rules will *not* result in disqualification... we''ll let the voters punish you!', '2021-11-15', '2021-11-28', '2021-11-29', '2021-12-05', 16, 0, 496, 65, 5.79839, 6.9667, 5.6774, 4.6207),
(3320, 'Extended Free Study 2021-11', 'Description Extended Free Study for November, 2021.', '2021-11-15', '2021-12-14', '2021-12-15', '2021-12-21', 28, 0, 705, 46, 5.93333, 7.3333, 5.8, 4.96),
(3321, 'Rocks, Stones, Pebbles IV (ARCHIVAL)', 'Description Thinking about Wynn Bullock today: "Not form rock, not object rock, but the light that IS the rock."', '2021-11-17', '2021-11-30', '2021-12-01', '2021-12-07', 45, 0, 1552, 22, 5.81057, 7.8485, 5.79745, 3.8387),
(3322, 'Forced Perspective II', 'Description Forced perspective is a technique that employs optical illusion to make an object appear farther away, closer, larger, or smaller than it actually is. It is used primarily in photography, filmmaking, and architecture.', '2021-11-19', '2021-12-02', '2021-12-03', '2021-12-09', 13, 0, 431, 22, 5.43387, 6.9394, 5.16665, 4.3636),
(3323, 'Feast VI', 'Description It doesn''t have to be a Thanksgiving meal: create whatever tickles your fancy.', '2021-11-22', '2021-12-05', '2021-12-06', '2021-12-12', 11, 0, 384, 28, 5.90365, 6.5429, 6.04285, 4.6286),
(3324, 'Ansel Adams V (ARCHIVAL)', 'Description It''s been seven years since the last Ansel Adams challenge. It''s time to once again visit the work of the iconic B/W landscape photographer, then pay homage with an image of your own that incorporates Ansel''s sense of light and drama in the landscape.', '2021-11-24', '2021-12-07', '2021-12-08', '2021-12-14', 44, 0, 1819, 59, 6.01154, 7.8537, 5.9524, 4.7143),
(3325, 'Bokeh XI', 'Description Loosely defined, bokeh is the quality and "feel" of the out-of-focus foreground or background elements of a photo. It isn''t very interesting by itself, but take a photograph whose subject is enhanced by foreground and/or background bokeh.', '2021-11-26', '2021-12-09', '2021-12-10', '2021-12-16', 19, 0, 572, 39, 5.78322, 8.1333, 5.6, 4.6333),
(3326, 'Flat Lay Still Life', 'Description Flat lay still life is used a lot in catalogs, books on various subjects, and artwork, too. Google the topic, then arrange your composition and photograph from directly above.', '2021-11-29', '2021-12-12', '2021-12-13', '2021-12-19', 23, 0, 820, 39, 5.87561, 7.1143, 5.7889, 4.5946),
(3328, 'Free Study 2021-12', 'Description Free Study for December, 2021.', '2021-12-01', '2021-12-31', '2022-01-01', '2022-01-07', 44, 0, 1583, 81, 5.96778, 7.2703, 5.9722, 4.8857),
