(3334, 'Blur III', 'Description Blur can be caused by motion of the the subject, camera, and/or missed focus. Create an image where blur is a feature, not a bug.', '2021-12-11', '2021-12-12', '2021-12-13', '2021-12-19', 29, 0, 1350, 82, 5.44074, 6.6304, 5.2717, 4.4565),
