(3439, 'For Sale II', 'Description Supermarkets, malls, convenience marts, farmers markets, flea markets, garage sales: all around us there is stuff for sale and places to sell it. This week, focus on creatively capturing an image of someplace where you can buy stuff or something that is for sale.', '2022-07-06', '2022-07-19', '2022-07-20', '2022-07-26', 22, 0, 776, 15, 5.2835, 6.2286, 5.3429, 4.1143),
