(3441, 'Shoreline with Structure', 'Description Jetties, piers, docks, wharves, bridges, dams, and water mills (to name a few examples) are all examples of land-anchored, human interaction with the shore. Show us an example.', '2022-07-11', '2022-07-24', '2022-07-25', '2022-07-31', 27, 1, 883, 116, 5.87995, 7.1212, 5.8182, 4.697),
