(3446, 'Wacky Panoramas', 'Description Strange things can happen when you mess around in-camera panoramas. Most of us have cell phones that can do these, and many, many consumer cameras can do them also. Photographing moving objects in Panorama Mode gets weird quickly, and there are other approaches as well. Let''s have fun!', '2022-07-20', '2022-08-02', '2022-08-03', '2022-08-09', 19, 0, 799, 36, 5.90363, 6.7857, 5.84525, 5.0732),
(3447, 'You Name It IV (ARCHIVAL)', 'Description Ever had trouble coming up with a good title? Just title your entry "You Name It!" sit back, and relax: Voters will have the fun of suggesting good titles in their comments. This is a time for both challenge participants and voters to have some good, clean fun.', '2022-07-22', '2022-08-04', '2022-08-05', '2022-08-11', 60, 2, 2889, 2108, 6.04292, 7.6, 6.0769, 4.6087),
