(3677, 'Haiku Photography', 'Description Take a photograph. Pair it with a Haiku of your own creation. Your title should be the Haiku, with the 3 lines separated by forward slash marks: "Haiku is / mist on the water / lingering" "Traditional" Haiku are 5-7-5 syllables. "Modern" Haiku in English are less strict about lines and syllables. Either will fulfill this challenge. See the Challenge Suggestions thread here for more information: thread', '2023-10-23', '2023-11-05', '2023-11-06', '2023-11-12', 34, 0, 1026, 22, 5.94932, 7.0667, 5.9333, 4.5172),
