(3763, 'DPC Cinema IV', 'Create your own movie poster! The catch? Your image title must be the title of your film and consist of 3 words with the initials "DPC"! Example: "Dead Potatoes Clapping"', '2024-04-10', '2024-04-23', '2024-04-24', '2024-04-30', 14, 0, 379, 13, 5.83377, 7.8519, 5.7407, 4.8571),
