(3767, 'Automotive Detail IV', 'Cars and trucks are chock-a-block full of interesting details, from headlights to taillights, and everything in between. Take a good look, and show us what you see.', '2024-04-17', '2024-04-30', '2024-05-01', '2024-05-07', 23, 0, 474, 9, 5.88819, 6.7727, 5.8524, 4.7),
