(3769, 'Body of Water IV', 'Oceans, rivers, ponds, lakes, streams, brooks, fjords, swamps, waterfalls, dams, reservoirs, puddles, etc. Natural water takes on many shapes. Capture a naturally made body of water or even a man made one like a reservoir. No water drops, wine glasses or man made containers.', '2024-04-22', '2024-05-05', '2024-05-06', '2024-05-12', 23, 0, 560, 24, 5.92143, 6.875, 5.9375, 4.9167),
