(3846, 'Abstract Motion Blur II', 'Moving camera, moving subject, or any combination thereof: use the technique to create an abstract image.', '2024-09-20', '2024-10-03', '2024-10-04', '2024-10-10', 26, 0, 685, 20, 5.83796, 6.8148, 5.8077, 4.5556),
(3847, 'Shapes in Black & White', 'Henri Cartier-Bresson once said, "The rhythm of surfaces, lines, and values is for me the essence of photography; composition should be a constant of preoccupation... an organic coordination of visual elements." Capture this sentiment by encapsulating the elements that abstract into light, texture, shape, and shadow.', '2024-09-23', '2024-10-06', '2024-10-07', '2024-10-13', 28, 0, 648, 12, 5.87809, 6.8696, 5.8696, 4.5833),
(3848, 'Floor or Ceiling II', 'Your choice... either the floor on the ceiling should be prominently featured in your photograph.', '2024-09-25', '2024-10-08', '2024-10-09', '2024-10-15', 30, 0, 585, 33, 5.77607, 7.0526, 5.7368, 4.35),
