(3874, 'Irving Penn', 'Irving Penn was a seminal American photographer who came to prominence in the early 1950s. His work was widely published and influenced a whole generation of photographers. Check out some examples and then try your hand at emulating his style and mood. Irving Penn Galleries', '2024-11-15', '2024-11-29', '2024-11-30', '2024-12-05', 21, 0, 449, 25, 5.86192, 7.4091, 5.7143, 4.9091),
