(3927, 'Street Photography VIII', 'Street photography is a type of documentary photography that usually features people in candid situations in public places such as streets, parks, beaches, malls, political conventions, and other settings. Go out and take your best photo using street photography techniques.', '2025-04-14', '2025-04-27', '2025-04-28', '2025-05-04', 25, 1, 733, 52, 5.78035, 6.7931, 5.74135, 5.1),
