(3939, 'Forced Perspective IV', 'Forced perspective is a technique that employs optical illusion to make an object appear farther away, closer, larger, or smaller than it actually is. It is used primarily in photography, filmmaking, and architecture.', '2025-07-07', '2025-07-20', '2025-07-21', '2025-07-27', 11, 0, 333, 15, 5.7958, 7.6774, 5.54085, 4.7333),
