(4113, 'Complementary Colors X', 'Use two complementary colors to compose your photograph. For those of you who need a refresher, your main sets of complementary colors are red/green, blue/orange, yellow/purple.', '2026-03-18', '2026-03-31', '2026-04-01', '2026-04-07', 27, 0, 772, 47, 6.04275, 7.1786, 6.0351, 4.7667),
