(4115, 'Micro Worlds', 'Brief: Capture the unseen beauty of tiny details - insects, moss, textures, everyday objects magnified, etc. Tips: Use macro lenses or close‑up filters. Look for surprising details in ordinary items. Examples: Ant trails, dew drops on grass, fabric weave.', '2026-04-01', '2026-04-14', '2026-04-15', '2026-04-21', 29, 0, 973, 84, 6.1223, 8.1212, 5.9844, 5.1563),
(4116, 'Past its Prime II', 'If it''s seen better days, if it''s gone to seed, if it''s long in the tooth or has one foot in the grave, memorialize it for us.', '2026-05-27', '2026-06-09', '2026-06-10', '2026-06-16', 42, 0, 1603, 89, 5.79726, 6.9737, 5.7436, 4.5946),
